TrustTunnel VPN client for OPNsense.

Joins a TrustTunnel endpoint: paste a tt://? deeplink, review the
trust-gate preview, confirm, and the client establishes a TUN tunnel.
Multi-server array with one active server.

The server (endpoint-hosting) role is the separate os-trusttunnel plugin.

WWW: https://github.com/mpanius/opnsense-trusttunnel
